#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<memfrob()> function encrypts the first I<n> bytes of the memory "
#| "area I<s> by exclusive-ORing each character with the number 42.  The "
#| "effect can be reversed by using B<memfrob()> on the encrypted memory area."
msgid ""
"The B<memfrob>()  function obfuscates the first I<n> bytes of the memory "
"area I<s> by exclusive-ORing each character with the number 42.  The effect "
"can be reversed by using B<memfrob>()  on the obfuscated memory area."
msgstr ""
"B<memfrob()> 함수는 메모리 영역 I<s>의 처음 I<n>를 숫자 42로 각 문자를 "
"exclusive-ORing하여 암호화 한다.  결과는 암호화된 영역에서 B<memfrob()>를 사"
"용하여 원래대로 할수 있다."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Note that this function is not a proper encryption routine as the XOR "
"constant is fixed, and is suitable only for hiding strings."
msgstr ""
"이 함수는 XOR 상수를 고정시켰기 때문에 적당한 암호화 루틴이 아니며 문자들을 "
"숨기는데만 알맞다는 점을 주의해라."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "반환값"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<memfrob()> function returns a pointer to the encrypted memory area."
msgid ""
"The B<memfrob>()  function returns a pointer to the obfuscated memory area."
msgstr "B<memfrob()> 함수는 암호화된 영역에 대한 포인터를 반환한다."

